4db7c.png)\n\nDescribe the set of points shown above using set-builder notation.\n\n$$\n{(x,y)\\in {{field-1}}\\,:\\,{{field-2}}\\le x\\le {{field-3}},\\,{{field-4}}\\le y\\le {{field-5}}}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Since all points $P(x,y)$ in our set lie at integer values of $x$ and $y,$ we have $x\\in Z,y\\in Z,$ and therefore \n\n$$\n(x,y)\\in Z\\times Z={Z}^{2}.\n$$\n\nThe points $P(x,y)$ satisfy the condition\n\n$$\nx\\in {-1,0,1,2},\\,y\\in {-2,-1,0,1,2,3}.\n$$\n\nIn other words,\n\n$$\n-1\\le x\\le 2,\\,-2\\le y\\le 3.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can write our set as follows:\n\n$$\n{(x,y)\\in {Z}^{2}\\,:\\,-1\\le x\\le 2,\\,-2\\le y\\le 3}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-181791/field-1" "q-181791/field-2" "q-181791/field-3" "q-181791/field-4" "q-181791/field-5"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "d9f0da82-f79b-5056-ac99-b401eb1630c7"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-181791"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-181970/field-1/203f88d94a38bb859e78e84aea518cf34952815758cf391887040455367d62ef" :answer/id #uuid "7336015d-180c-52f4-bd6b-b93a95c068bf" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "N" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-181970/field-1/cfebd74d1bfcdc28a2ab76bc7b9cb134cbb44312ed3e16d5a0610048f75355ad" :answer/id #uuid "ea69fb5e-da6b-5c02-9e0c-dc9468c557e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{N}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-181970/field-1/07d4d169afe54b72e6508fedd544e5d357fac0ff0f623249ab3b7f264f513fcf" :answer/id #uuid "f509ce1b-67e5-51bc-beba-08a2ee6e05ec" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "{R}^{2}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-181970/field-1/a1f44d584f3d5c0539cb338e6289ad49d176231f52c1da87f334282351fe2472" :answer/id #uuid "9f0218fd-0042-5231-bd4d-a9a816216f0f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "R" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-181970/field-1/7d512723ec7933fc53d818fe067378407b